brew bundle can't satisfy your Brewfile's dependencies.
→ Tap homebrew/autoupdate needs to be tapped.
→ Cask nosuchcask-zzz needs to be installed.
→ Cask spacectl needs to be installed.
→ VSCode Extension nosuch.extension-zzz needs to be installed.
→ Formula cowsay needs to be installed.
Satisfy missing dependencies with `brew bundle install`.
